title: Close without saving ends the app and leaves the files on disk as they were
prefs: {"autosave": false}
folders: edit-odd
limit: 40
forbid-log: cannot edit
forbid-log: nothing offers
forbid-log: saved
expect-file: edit-odd/a.txt :: (?-i)\Afirst of a\nsecond of a\n\z
expect-file: edit-odd/b.txt :: (?-i)\Afirst of b\nsecond of b\n\z

wait 3000
edit a.txt 1 1
type A1
key enter
edit b.txt 1 1
key delete
key delete
quit
wait 1000
mark asked
wait 500
answer Close without saving
wait 1000
